# Addresses

_Reference for zama-protocol skill (zama-protocol plugin)_

# Deployment Discovery

Use the [official address index](https://docs.zama.org/protocol/protocol-apps/addresses), then select the exact chain. Verify deployed bytecode, proxy implementation and protocol release before relying on an address. Never invent addresses or infer network support from a preset alone.

For confidential wrappers, use the chain's published registry or SDK wrapper-discovery APIs. Keep the underlying ERC-20 and ERC-7984 wrapper addresses distinct; read `decimals()` and `rate()` from the actual wrapper. Their units can differ.

Configure FHE through the installed library's chain-appropriate `ZamaConfig`. For application examples, use the **zama-solidity** mainnet code map. Private deployment manifests and private repository links are not public documentation.
